<title>UK: Bangladesh to tender for 25,000 white sugar.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh to tender for 25,000 white sugar.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh is to hold a tender to buy 25,000 tonnes of white sugar for second half August shipment, trade sources said.</p>
<p>The tender will be held in early July but no specific date has yet been announced.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
